# Do not repeat

Home + shared `Nav`/`Footer` are the template. Case studies must use `CaseStudyPage`, not pasted chrome.

## Never clone

1. White nav/footer on a white page. Use `Nav tone="light"` on case studies; `tone="photo"` only over the floral hero.
2. Dead About. About must go to the home hero (`id="about"`), not a missing hash and not a separate About section.
3. CTA text on an unlinked card (WCASL has no destination — no CTA).
4. `Placeholder` when `public/` already has the asset (Falling Fruit images are wired).
5. A second palette or type scale that makes case studies look like another site.
6. New nav/footer markup per page — use `src/components/Nav.jsx` and `Footer.jsx`.
7. Extra Google-font loads (`index.html` only).
8. `href="#"` for the site name.

Plastic Beach still has no images in `public/`. Placeholders there are missing content, not a look.

## Motion

Keep `prefers-reduced-motion` and `:focus-visible` on the star cursor.
